                            хотя о нем не сказано в документации
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Пример:
                        </p>

                        <blockquote style=""text-align:left;"">
                            <code>
                                <span style=""color: #07a"">from</span> ultralytics <span style=""color: #07a"">import</span> YOLO
                                </br>
                                model = YOLO<span style=""color: #999"">(</span><span style=""color: #690"">""yolov8n""</span><span style=""color: #999"">)</span>
                                </br>
                                model.export<span style=""color: #999"">(</span>
                                </br>
                            ");
            WriteLiteral(@"    format=<span style=""color: #690"">""onnx""</span>,
                                </br>
                                imgsz=<span style=""color: #905"">640</span>,
                                </br>
                                opset=<span style=""color: #905"">12</span>,
                                </br>
                                batch=<span style=""color: #905"">4</span><span style=""color: #999"">)</span>
                            </code>
                        </blockquote>
                        <h4>
                            PyTorch
                        </h4>
                        <p>
                            Если есть pytorch модель, ее можно экспортировать с помощью <a target=""_blank"" href=""https://pytorch.org/docs/stable/onnx.html"" style=""cursor:pointer;color:#EB5757;word-wrap:break-word;font-family:&quot;SFMono-Regular&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;PT Mono&quot;, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:rgba(135,131,120,.15)");
            WriteLiteral(@";border-radius:3px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;text-decoration:inherit"" class=""notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"" data-token-index=""1"" tabindex=""0""><span style=""border-bottom:0.05em solid;border-color:rgba(55,53,47,.4);opacity:0.7"" class=""link-annotation-5096037c-e11d-4079-8115-46caf937248e-835745179"">torch.onnx.export</span></a>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Пример:
                        </p>

                        <blockquote style=""text-align:left;"">
                            <code>
                                <span style=""color: #07a"">import</span> torch
                                </br>
                                <span style=""color: #07a"">import</span> torchvision.models <span style=""color: #07a"">as</span> models
                                </br>
                                BATCH_SIZE = <span style=""color: #905"">1</span>
                                ");
